{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787186113897118002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"reluctant-undeniable-crane","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"43cb359bb4e8c77a01e8cd1ef6c29e2fdac69c9626463332c06011ce22f988ef","event_uuid":"f1012480-d871-4573-a02e-9adbe90100da","position":{"commit_sha":"92254b77c8fb5df99434759c4d9dc8983447c40d","position":"1787185966335615001-f1012480-d871-4573-a02e-9adbe90100da"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"dafe60516318461a806d39694294f9592c329e8d9f3ae08d40990935c0f364bd","event_uuid":"dced7568-e0e3-4230-be66-829be735b1a3","position":{"commit_sha":"8f71fafab143fa572874980eaebdd13e6656acac","position":"1787186055433600001-dced7568-e0e3-4230-be66-829be735b1a3"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"fac63740b17695378053ad857f9efebe8f3509461b7382e01009a7ea9a3f7a99","event_uuid":"0eef5cf0-d966-4cdc-aac4-605920eaeff3","position":{"commit_sha":"0c9890e0a387c1033ab9359a393a11b4e5167892","position":"1787186113897118001-0eef5cf0-d966-4cdc-aac4-605920eaeff3"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787185966335615001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"dced7568-e0e3-4230-be66-829be735b1a3","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"3726-a1b0-c9bb-4d83"}],"description":"## What\n\nCut the emit-side surfaces over to `[non-codebase]`, teaching the recognition-side surfaces to\naccept the legacy spelling without documenting it.\n\nCUTOVER (emit): `plan_review_E2.md:12`, `plan_review_E6.md:12`, `plan_review_F1.md:10`,\n`coach_moves.py` move 14 (comment + template).\nCOMPATIBILITY (recognize both): `completion_verifier.md`, `plan_review_evidence_kind.md`,\n`plan_review_ac_process_gate.md`, `.rebar/prompts/plan-review-project-measurement-provenance.md`\n(its SCOPE clause gates whether the criterion applies at all), the eval-spec fixtures.\n\n## Why this is ONE commit\n\nThree gates are coupled to this text and all fail if split:\n1. `tests/unit/test_measurement_provenance_criterion.py` pins SHA256 digests AND exact line\n   counts for five files. Its `_contract_lines()` selector keeps lines containing\n   `\"OPERATOR-ATTESTED RULE\"` or `\"[operator-attested]\"` — cut over without widening the\n   SELECTOR and it matches ZERO lines, failing with a misleading\n   \"expected 1 contract line(s), found 0\".\n2. `docs/plan-review-criteria-guide.md` is generated from these prompts and gated by\n   `registry.validate_criteria_guide(...) == []` in five test files plus content pins in\n   `tests/unit/test_generated_surface_markers.py`.\n3. The `reviewers/index.json` drift gate fires on any front-matter change.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Emit-side prompts and coach move 14 instruct `[non-codebase]`.\n- [ ] Recognition-side prompts state that the legacy spelling is still accepted.\n- [ ] `_contract_lines()` selects the new text; digests and counts are recomputed in this commit.\n- [ ] `python -m rebar.llm.plan_review.registry regenerate-criteria-guide` run and committed;\n      `validate_criteria_guide` returns `[]`.\n- [ ] `make lint` and `make typecheck` pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/reviewers/plan_review_E2.md","reason":"emit-side cutover"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/reviewers/plan_review_E6.md","reason":"emit-side cutover"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/reviewers/plan_review_F1.md","reason":"emit-side cutover"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/coach_moves.py","reason":"move 14 comment and template"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/reviewers/completion_verifier.md","reason":"recognize both spellings"},{"path":"docs/plan-review-criteria-guide.md","reason":"regenerated output"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_measurement_provenance_criterion.py","reason":"widen _contract_lines selector, recompute digests and counts"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","3726-a1b0-c9bb-4d83"],["parent","6f5a-4a49-7bbf-4a30"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"6f5a-4a49-7bbf-4a30","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f371-ca39-181c-4091","ticket_type":"story","title":"S4 — cut prompts, coach text and the generated guide over to [non-codebase]","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f1012480-d871-4573-a02e-9adbe90100da","dced7568-e0e3-4230-be66-829be735b1a3","0eef5cf0-d966-4cdc-aac4-605920eaeff3"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787186113897118002,"uuid":"51d7462a-69f8-431c-ae59-bb7631f9093c"}